  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onions, carrots, and celery, and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add chopped parsley and dill, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in orange juice and vegetable broth, and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in bonito flakes and season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!",
    "Use a binchotan grill to prepare the meal for a smoky flavor.",
    "Garnish with additional chopped herbs, if desired.",
    "Serve with a side of crusty bread or over rice."
